Package: TRexSelector
Type: Package
Title: T-Rex Selector: High-Dimensional Variable Selection and FDR
        Control
Version: 2.0.1
Description: Variable selection for regression and classification in high-dimensional
 settings with control of the false discovery rate (FDR) at a user-specified target level.
 The implementations are primarily based on the T-Rex selector of Machkour, Muma and
 Palomar (2025) <doi:10.1016/j.sigpro.2025.109894> and its dependency-aware extension for
 correlated variables by Machkour, Muma and Palomar (2025) <doi:10.1016/j.sigpro.2025.109990>.
 Since version 2.0.0 the package comes as R bindings to the 'TRexSelector' C++ library, which
 replaces the pure-R implementation of the 1.x releases.
